{
  "wireMagic": "pb3",
  "pens": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wsWinStyles": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wpWinPositions": [ {
  
  } ],
  "events": [ {
    "tStartMs": 160,
    "dDurationMs": 880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Billionaires."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1040,
    "dDurationMs": 3240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They are richer today\nthan they've been in decades."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4320,
    "dDurationMs": 1080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But according to economists"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5400,
    "dDurationMs": 4080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "like Gabriel Zucman,\nthey do not pay their fair share in taxes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 9600,
    "dDurationMs": 3800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "While average Americans\npay an effective tax rate of about 30%."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 13720,
    "dDurationMs": 4080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Forbes 400 richest individuals\npay only 28%."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 18120,
    "dDurationMs": 3320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And paradoxically, in Europe,\nthings are even more extreme."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 21440,
    "dDurationMs": 4280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Whereas middle-class Europeans\npay around 50% and taxes"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 26040,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "billionaires pay only about 20 to 30%."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 30080,
    "dDurationMs": 3200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "However, every time\nsomeone talks about taxing the ultra"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 33280,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "rich, you always hear the same response."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 36280,
    "dDurationMs": 3800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They will simply pack up their bags\nand leave to Monaco,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 40080,
    "dDurationMs": 4640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Switzerland, Dubai or any other country\nthat offers a better tax deal."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 45120,
    "dDurationMs": 3240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The UK tried taxing the rich in the 1970s"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 48520,
    "dDurationMs": 2960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and it lost the Rolling Stones\nand David Bowie."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 51480,
    "dDurationMs": 3920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "France tried in 2012 and lost Gérard\nDepardieu."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 55920,
    "dDurationMs": 4440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Norway tried in 2022 and faced\na significant exodus of billionaires."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 60680,
    "dDurationMs": 2680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "On the other hand,\nthe Lego and Maersk families"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 63360,
    "dDurationMs": 4960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "famously stayed in Denmark\nafter it abolished its wealth tax in 1997."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 68720,
    "dDurationMs": 4920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And when Sweden did the same in 2007,\nit famously saw the return of icons"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 73640,
    "dDurationMs": 4360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "like Ikea founder Ingvar\nKamprad and Bjorn Borg."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 78120,
    "dDurationMs": 4200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The political right argues\nthat taxing the rich is simply a bad deal,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 82320,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because if they leave to flee high taxes,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 85520,
    "dDurationMs": 2920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they will take their companies\nand jobs with them."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 88440,
    "dDurationMs": 1240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And if enough, leave."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 89680,
    "dDurationMs": 3280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This could even mean that\nby raising taxes on the wealthy,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 93240,
    "dDurationMs": 4320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the government ends up collecting\nfewer taxes overall."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 98000,
    "dDurationMs": 2840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now the left will counter\nthat this is nonsense."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 100840,
    "dDurationMs": 3560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Sure, a few may leave,\nbut wealth taxes will still help fund"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 104680,
    "dDurationMs": 5120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "social policies and billionaires\ndon't produce that much value anyway."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 110160,
    "dDurationMs": 4560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So if some leave, they leave\nbehind a more equal, harmonious society."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 115160,
    "dDurationMs": 3640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, the problem is that nobody knows\nat which point higher taxes"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 118800,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "on the rich become self-defeating."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 120600,
    "dDurationMs": 5400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So the debate ends up dominated\nby sensationalist headlines and anecdotes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 126040,
    "dDurationMs": 3200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Luckily for us, a new study\nin the prestigious journal the American"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 129240,
    "dDurationMs": 3960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Economic Review dug into an extraordinary\namount of Swedish and Danish"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 133240,
    "dDurationMs": 3920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "administrative records\nto see how the wealthy actually respond"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 137320,
    "dDurationMs": 2240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "when the wealth tax changes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 139560,
    "dDurationMs": 4440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And this means that for the first time,\nwe now have evidence based calculations"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 144240,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "on how many billionaires will leave,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 146280,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "what happens to their businesses\nand the economy as a whole."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 149440,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you truly tax billionaires\nwhere it hurts."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 152880,
    "dDurationMs": 3320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So before we settle\nthe debate between left and right once"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 156200,
    "dDurationMs": 5320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and for all, we need to start with the tax\nthat the ultra rich hate the most."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 162000,
    "dDurationMs": 1600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You see, most millionaires\nand billionaires"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 163600,
    "dDurationMs": 3080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "do not earn their income\nby working for a wage."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 166680,
    "dDurationMs": 3840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Instead, they make most of their income\nby far from their capital,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 170520,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "their properties, their stocks,\nand their private companies."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 174480,
    "dDurationMs": 5440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But while it's pretty straightforward\nto tax wages and dividends, it's"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 179920,
    "dDurationMs": 4880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "actually quite difficult to tax so-called\ncapital gains as the prices are going up."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 185160,
    "dDurationMs": 1480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For two reasons."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 186640,
    "dDurationMs": 1760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The first reason is practical."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 188400,
    "dDurationMs": 4240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The asset class that billionaires benefit\nmost from are private companies."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 192800,
    "dDurationMs": 3320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Take billionaire owned Ikea\nfrom Sweden or Lego from Denmark."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 196200,
    "dDurationMs": 3800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What are these companies worth\nsince they are not regularly traded?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 200040,
    "dDurationMs": 1880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Nobody is really sure."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 201920,
    "dDurationMs": 3520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, the second reason that wealth taxes\nare difficult is political."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 205520,
    "dDurationMs": 4760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You see why companies that are traded like\nElon Musk's space X are easy to value."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 210560,
    "dDurationMs": 1840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They can swing pretty wildly."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 212400,
    "dDurationMs": 4320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For example, just a few days ago, Elon\nMusk was the world's first trillionaire."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 216960,
    "dDurationMs": 4120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But as of recording this video, SpaceX\nalready lost so much value"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 221280,
    "dDurationMs": 5040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that Musk's personal wealth\ndropped by 13% in just two weeks."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 226640,
    "dDurationMs": 3400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And that means that the government,\nif they try to tax his capital gains"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 230040,
    "dDurationMs": 3440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "at 30% just two weeks ago, his tax bill"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 233480,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "now could have been 50% instead."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 236520,
    "dDurationMs": 3280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Of course, you could argue that\nin the case of Musk, he will be fine."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 239800,
    "dDurationMs": 3320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But given that most governments\nwant a predictable tax system,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 243120,
    "dDurationMs": 5440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they have chosen to only charge a capital\ngains tax when such gains are realized."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 248640,
    "dDurationMs": 4440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That is when billionaires themselves\nchoose to sell their assets."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 253560,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But what if you never sell your assets,\nyour stocks,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 256720,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and your company,\nand you never distribute dividends?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 260160,
    "dDurationMs": 3960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, in that case, you can sit and watch\nhow your assets appreciate"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 264560,
    "dDurationMs": 3760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "while never worrying\nabout paying any taxes at all."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 268600,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And that's why Warren Buffett"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 270520,
    "dDurationMs": 3240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "famously said that he paid less taxes\nthan his secretary."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 274280,
    "dDurationMs": 4080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He could just hold onto his stocks,\nwatch them grow, and borrow against them"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 278360,
    "dDurationMs": 5320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to finance a comfortable lifestyle\nwithout ever paying a dime in taxes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 283880,
    "dDurationMs": 3360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, to avoid these kind of tricky issues,\nmany economists argue"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 287240,
    "dDurationMs": 3200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that it would be simpler\nif workers pay an income tax,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 290440,
    "dDurationMs": 4520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "while the super wealthy simply pay\na small percentage of their total wealth."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 294960,
    "dDurationMs": 3520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A wealth tax. If you're extremely wealthy,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 298960,
    "dDurationMs": 3040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you have to pay a minimum\neach and every year."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 302040,
    "dDurationMs": 1200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "No exception."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 303240,
    "dDurationMs": 3400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And that minimum has to be expressed\nas a fraction of your wealth."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 306960,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If properly implemented,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 309120,
    "dDurationMs": 5280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "billionaires absolutely hate wealth taxes\nbecause these cannot simply be dodged"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 314560,
    "dDurationMs": 3360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "by never paying out dividends\nor not selling shares."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 318440,
    "dDurationMs": 1760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Therefore, wealth taxes typically cause"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 320200,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a lot of billionaires\nto complain about them first."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 323200,
    "dDurationMs": 3200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And if that doesn't work,\nthey threaten to leave."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 327000,
    "dDurationMs": 3360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And because most billionaire wealth\nis tied up in financial markets"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 330720,
    "dDurationMs": 5360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and private businesses, that can be fairly\neasily moved out of the country."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 336240,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And we live in a world\nof free trade and capital."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 339360,
    "dDurationMs": 4200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And therefore the easiest way to escape\na wealth tax is by simply moving"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 343560,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to another country\nand taking your firm with you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 348360,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But do billionaires actually do this?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 351760,
    "dDurationMs": 4760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is where Jakobsen's and her co-authors'\nnew research paper comes in."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 357040,
    "dDurationMs": 2600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Both Sweden and Denmark used to have"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 359640,
    "dDurationMs": 3480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "an annual wealth tax of around\n2% on that wealth."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 363720,
    "dDurationMs": 4360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Denmark\nabolished it in 1996 and Sweden in 2007."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 368840,
    "dDurationMs": 3160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Both countries had pretty\nsophisticated systems to measure wealth"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 372240,
    "dDurationMs": 4440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and can track how many wealthy residents\nwere emigrating each year."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 377000,
    "dDurationMs": 3720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And this allowed researchers to calculate\nexactly"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 381120,
    "dDurationMs": 3360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "how much you can tax billionaires\nbefore they leave."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 385000,
    "dDurationMs": 4880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So the answer from Sweden and Denmark,\nit seems to be even"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 389880,
    "dDurationMs": 4400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "if you raise the wealth tax a little bit,\nsome billionaires will leave."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 394320,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So how much can you tax before I leave?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 396320,
    "dDurationMs": 1760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Some will always leave."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 398080,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's more about how many will leave."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 400120,
    "dDurationMs": 3160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Concretely,\nafter Sweden abolished its 2% wealth tax,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 403280,
    "dDurationMs": 4320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it saw a reduction\nin 34% of wealthy people leaving."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 408120,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But that may sound like a lot,\nbut consider this"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 410640,
    "dDurationMs": 3160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "only 0.34% of ultra rich"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 414080,
    "dDurationMs": 3880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Swedish were emigrating every year\nbefore the tax was abolished."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 418400,
    "dDurationMs": 4920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So even with a wealth tax over\n99% of wealthy Swedes preferred"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 423320,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "staying in Sweden."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 424320,
    "dDurationMs": 3280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So because only a tiny number\nof billionaires emigrated here."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 427920,
    "dDurationMs": 3520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This means that a 1% increase\nin the top wealth tax rate"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 431760,
    "dDurationMs": 3080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "decreases the stock of wealthy taxpayers"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 435240,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "by about 2%."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 438440,
    "dDurationMs": 3880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But this relatively small fact\ncould be because the Swedish wealth"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 442320,
    "dDurationMs": 1480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "tax had a unique feature."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 443800,
    "dDurationMs": 3800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You have to be honest,\nit fully exempted, so it didn't count."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 447800,
    "dDurationMs": 2680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Assets held in private corporations."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 450480,
    "dDurationMs": 3560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And that means if you were a 1990s\nstartup founder in Stockholm"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 454280,
    "dDurationMs": 4120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and you never had to sell your shares,\nyou could breathe easily because"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 458640,
    "dDurationMs": 3520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the value locked inside your company\nlargely escape this wealth tax."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 462480,
    "dDurationMs": 2960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "On the other hand, in Denmark,\nwhich the authors also looked at,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 465440,
    "dDurationMs": 2920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "private companies were not exempt,\nso you'd expect"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 468360,
    "dDurationMs": 3360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a much bigger effect\nof abolishing the wealth tax there."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 472600,
    "dDurationMs": 1440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But that wasn't the case."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 474040,
    "dDurationMs": 5240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The authors found roughly the same effect\na 1% increase in the top wealth tax"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 479600,
    "dDurationMs": 5280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "decreased the stock\nof billionaire taxpayers by about 2%."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 485200,
    "dDurationMs": 3280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So the result was actually pretty robust\nacross borders."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 488680,
    "dDurationMs": 1840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And therefore,\nif we apply the main result of"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 490520,
    "dDurationMs": 3680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "this paper to, for example,\nthe UK green parties, politicians"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 494440,
    "dDurationMs": 4880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that Polanski's 2% wealth tax proposal\nfor all wealth over 1 billion pounds."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 500040,
    "dDurationMs": 4560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Then the evidence from Sweden\nand Denmark implies that the UK will lose"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 504720,
    "dDurationMs": 3240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "4% of these wealthy taxpayers."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 508320,
    "dDurationMs": 4480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, importantly, what does that mean\nfor wealth tax revenue?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 513120,
    "dDurationMs": 3240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, doing a quick back of the net thing\ncalculation,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 516640,
    "dDurationMs": 3560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "there were 156 billionaires\nin the UK in 2025."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 520560,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Together\nthey controlled around 654 billion pounds."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 524440,
    "dDurationMs": 4360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And given that 156 billion in wealth\nwould be exempt from the 2%,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 529400,
    "dDurationMs": 3400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "there would roughly be 498\nbillion left to tax."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 533120,
    "dDurationMs": 4520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now we could calculate that just 4% of UK\nbillionaires will leave,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 537640,
    "dDurationMs": 4280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and therefore there will be\na slightly lower wealth tax revenue."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 542160,
    "dDurationMs": 1600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But that would be too simple."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 543760,
    "dDurationMs": 3240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Because billionaires\ndon't just pay wealth taxes,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 547000,
    "dDurationMs": 3760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they also pay other taxes,\nprimarily income taxes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 551400,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Luckily, the researchers also took this\ninto account for Sweden and Denmark"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 555640,
    "dDurationMs": 4560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and estimated that for every dollar\nkrona found one in wealth taxes,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 560200,
    "dDurationMs": 5720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "about only $0.22 are lost\non other taxes from billionaires leaving."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 566080,
    "dDurationMs": 3680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And based on these numbers,\nthe UK wealth tax should bring in about"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 569760,
    "dDurationMs": 3160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "498 billion times 2%."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 572920,
    "dDurationMs": 5600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Times\n78% is 7.8 billion pounds every year."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 578720,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's a significant amount of money."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 581240,
    "dDurationMs": 4360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The government of the UK could use this\nto really fully fund their plan."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 585640,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's already there to buy a new battery."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 587680,
    "dDurationMs": 4040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Factories, six clean steel plants,\nnine renewable ready ports"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 591720,
    "dDurationMs": 4400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and a hydrogen electric plant\nand several net zero clusters."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 596160,
    "dDurationMs": 1360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's great news."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 597520,
    "dDurationMs": 3760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But on the total government\nbudget of 1,368"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 601280,
    "dDurationMs": 3720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "billion pounds, it's pocket change."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 605040,
    "dDurationMs": 2480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's roughly half a percent."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 607520,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So while the right is correct\nthat while taxes caused billionaires"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 611520,
    "dDurationMs": 4080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to leave, the best evidence that we have\nshows us that the left is correct,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 615600,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that not enough billionaires\nleave to offset the wealth tax."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 619200,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But that intellectual victory\nis really slim."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 622200,
    "dDurationMs": 3880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you consider that we are talking about\njust half a percent"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 626080,
    "dDurationMs": 1440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of the government budget."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 627520,
    "dDurationMs": 920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "To make matters worse,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 628440,
    "dDurationMs": 3360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "we have only considered the effect\nof billionaires leaving on taxes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 632000,
    "dDurationMs": 2920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But as you can see here\nfrom this graph of Sweden,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 634920,
    "dDurationMs": 3720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "most people do actually work for the rich\nand for the ultra rich,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 639320,
    "dDurationMs": 4320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "either directly as an employee\nor indirectly as a contractor."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 643960,
    "dDurationMs": 5160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So this gets us to our next major question\nabout taxing the billionaire class."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 649240,
    "dDurationMs": 3240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Real rich people leaving\nhurt the economy again."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 652480,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The Sweden paper offers\na very interesting insight."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 655760,
    "dDurationMs": 4200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The researchers could actually follow\nwhat happened to the businesses"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 659960,
    "dDurationMs": 3640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that these wealthy emigrants left behind."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 664320,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the picture is not pretty."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 666480,
    "dDurationMs": 3760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "At first glance, when a business owners\nsubject to the wealth"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 670240,
    "dDurationMs": 3360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "tax left the country,\nthe company took a real hit."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 674000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Jobs fell by a third, investment\ndropped by a fifth,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 677160,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and the value of the firm\nproduced shrank by a third."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 681120,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The taxes\nit paid were roughly cut in half."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 684240,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "To put it in plain terms."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 685920,
    "dDurationMs": 3840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "An owner leaves and the company\nthey build will start to decay."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 690120,
    "dDurationMs": 4320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But on the bright side,\nbecause so few wealthy people"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 694440,
    "dDurationMs": 3480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "were actually leaving because of\nthe wealth tax in the first place,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 698480,
    "dDurationMs": 3520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "abolishing the wealth tax barely affected\nthe economy as a whole."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 702480,
    "dDurationMs": 4520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We're talking a few hundredths\nof a percent on jobs and investments,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 707000,
    "dDurationMs": 4240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and about 2/10 of a percent\non the size of the economy"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 711800,
    "dDurationMs": 1240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "at the level of the whole country."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 713040,
    "dDurationMs": 4200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The effect of the tax exodus\nwas almost invisible."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 717600,
    "dDurationMs": 3840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So taxing the ultra\nrich does not bring in much money,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 721840,
    "dDurationMs": 2600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but it also does not crash the economy."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 724440,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So we should just do it anyway, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 727440,
    "dDurationMs": 1720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For the sake of fairness."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 729160,
    "dDurationMs": 3680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well hold on, there's one\nfeature of wealth taxes"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 732840,
    "dDurationMs": 3280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that we don't actually talk\nabout that much in public debate."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 736560,
    "dDurationMs": 2760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But surprisingly,\nit came out of this research paper"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 739320,
    "dDurationMs": 3960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "as the real problem with wealth taxes,\nwhich is that private firms"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 743280,
    "dDurationMs": 4160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that are not listed and are therefore\nhard to value because they are not traded."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 747480,
    "dDurationMs": 1520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They are the real problem."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 749000,
    "dDurationMs": 3760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For example, even a country like Norway\nthat tracks almost perfectly"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 752760,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "even how much\nyour car collection is worth."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 755760,
    "dDurationMs": 3320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They were not able to properly value\nprivate firms."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 759600,
    "dDurationMs": 2680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Therefore,\nthey ended up valuing them based purely on"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 762280,
    "dDurationMs": 3280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "hard assets like buildings\nand bank accounts in the firm."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 766080,
    "dDurationMs": 4680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But because the real value in most firms\ncomes from intangible stuff, stuff"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 770760,
    "dDurationMs": 4440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you can attach like a brand or a technical\nknowhow and customer loyalty."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 775360,
    "dDurationMs": 4280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "These firms ended up being structurally\nundervalued by governments."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 780240,
    "dDurationMs": 3960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And this then created a massive incentive\nfor the billionaire class"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 784680,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that stayed behind,\nwhich are most of them,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 788040,
    "dDurationMs": 2800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to try and dodge wealth taxes\nby moving their wealth"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 790840,
    "dDurationMs": 3800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "from things that can be valued,\nlike stock markets and property,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 794880,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "into private companies\nthat are difficult to value."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 798480,
    "dDurationMs": 3320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And as we've seen,\nprivate firms are a substantial share"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 801800,
    "dDurationMs": 3560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of billionaire wealth, much larger\nthan property, for example."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 805560,
    "dDurationMs": 1520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Another good example is Spain."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 807080,
    "dDurationMs": 5440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When it reintroduced its wealth\ntax in 2011, they exempted business assets"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 812520,
    "dDurationMs": 5160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "along with primary residences where people\nactually live from the tax base."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 818160,
    "dDurationMs": 1120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That sounds reasonable."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 819280,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You want to protect small business\nowners and homeowners."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 822360,
    "dDurationMs": 880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But what actually happened?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 823240,
    "dDurationMs": 1640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There was a massive reallocation"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 824880,
    "dDurationMs": 3040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of wealth towards\nprivate firms and massive villas."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 828240,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Someone holding stocks would sell them\nand buy a house."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 831280,
    "dDurationMs": 3200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Someone with diversified\ninvestments would shift into business"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 834800,
    "dDurationMs": 3280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "shares of private companies\nand as a result, the wealth tax base"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 838120,
    "dDurationMs": 6120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "collapsed by between 42% to 51% after the\nintroduction of the Spanish wealth tax."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 844240,
    "dDurationMs": 3720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And this is exactly what the Sweden\nDenmark paper also found."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 848320,
    "dDurationMs": 3960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Remember that $0.22 lost\nto people fleeing the country?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 852280,
    "dDurationMs": 3640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For every dollar taxed well,\nthe wealthy will stay put"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 856200,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because the Treasury more than twice that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 859520,
    "dDurationMs": 2920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "roughly $0.54 on the dollar."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 862440,
    "dDurationMs": 4200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "By quietly rearranging their portfolios,\nsaving less and dodging the tax,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 867440,
    "dDurationMs": 3040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they rendered a lot of the wealth\ntax useless."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 870840,
    "dDurationMs": 4680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, when you combine the $0.22 lost\nof billionaires fleeing with the $0.54"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 875680,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "lost to billionaires dodging\ninside the borders of your country,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 879200,
    "dDurationMs": 3880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "your shiny new wealth tax loses\n76% of its power."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 883320,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Only $0.24 on every krona, pound"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 886200,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or dollar\ncould theoretically be collected."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 889280,
    "dDurationMs": 3760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, adjusting our back of the napkin\ncalculation for the UK, that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 893040,
    "dDurationMs": 6480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "2% billion in tax would not bring in 7.8\nbillion, it would bring in closer to 2.4"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 899520,
    "dDurationMs": 5160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "billion, a microscopic 0.7% of the total\nUK government spending."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 904800,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And just while this calculation is very\nrough,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 906800,
    "dDurationMs": 3280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "estimations are based just on the evidence\nfrom Sweden and Denmark."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 910560,
    "dDurationMs": 4240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It is actually consistent with what\nwe know from countries that still run"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 914800,
    "dDurationMs": 5840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "wealth taxes in Norway, where the wealth\ntax targeted the upper classes in general."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 920960,
    "dDurationMs": 1120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Not just billionaires."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 922080,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I brought in a little bit more."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 923760,
    "dDurationMs": 3880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The wealth tax still brings in less\nthan 2% of total government revenue."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 928200,
    "dDurationMs": 3640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In Spain, that's even less,\nbut nothing but nowhere near enough"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 932120,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to bankroll the ambitious programs"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 935280,
    "dDurationMs": 4200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that politicians usually talk about\nwhen discussing wealth taxes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 939560,
    "dDurationMs": 5120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, in conclusion, the evidence\nfrom the Scandinavian experience is clear."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 944720,
    "dDurationMs": 4520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You can tax the rich more,\nand while it will cause some billionaires"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 949240,
    "dDurationMs": 3760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to leave, absolutely it will not cause\na true billionaire exodus."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 953480,
    "dDurationMs": 3480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But sadly,\nwealth taxes are no miracle solution."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 957400,
    "dDurationMs": 1240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Even if billionaires did"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 958640,
    "dDurationMs": 4320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "not react to them, they would just bring\nin a fraction of government revenue"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 963280,
    "dDurationMs": 3280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "simply\nbecause billionaires do not own that much."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 966840,
    "dDurationMs": 3080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Compared to how much the government\nspends each year."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 970560,
    "dDurationMs": 3240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yet if we take into account\nthat some billionaires do leave,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 974200,
    "dDurationMs": 4320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and the ones that stay behind abused,\nthe fact that you cannot easily value"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 978800,
    "dDurationMs": 5040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "private companies, you should expect\nthat only $0.24 will be left"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 984120,
    "dDurationMs": 5760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for every dollar or euro that wealth taxes\nshould theoretically raise."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 990160,
    "dDurationMs": 3040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So should we just give up on taxing\nbillionaires altogether?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 993440,
    "dDurationMs": 2320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "No, that's not the point of this video\nat all."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 995760,
    "dDurationMs": 3240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "While it is contested,\nthe evidence of billionaires pay a lower"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 999000,
    "dDurationMs": 4400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "tax rate in most countries than even\nthe middle class is pretty strong."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1003720,
    "dDurationMs": 2760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So the tax system is what they call"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1006480,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "regressive, at least at the very top."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1009720,
    "dDurationMs": 4520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Most on the political left want to see\na progressive tax system instead."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1014240,
    "dDurationMs": 4760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And on the right there are some voices\nthat would want a flat tax,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1019760,
    "dDurationMs": 1480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the same rate for everyone, that is."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1021240,
    "dDurationMs": 3200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But even on the right,\nthere are not many people that argue that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1024440,
    "dDurationMs": 3760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "billionaires should pay a lower tax rate\nthan the middle class."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1028360,
    "dDurationMs": 3880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So for a smart politician,\nthere is actually a lot of political"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1032240,
    "dDurationMs": 3520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "capital available to make the tax system\nmore fair."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1035800,
    "dDurationMs": 2440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "People genuinely probably want that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1038240,
    "dDurationMs": 2680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And sure, we have seen today\nsome pretty compelling evidence"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1040920,
    "dDurationMs": 4640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that wealth taxes alone\nare unlikely to be a miracle solution."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1045840,
    "dDurationMs": 3480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But that doesn't mean that the tax system\nis impossible to fix."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1049640,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It just means that if you want the rich\nto pay their fair share,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1053440,
    "dDurationMs": 4520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you will need to find the right mix\nof income taxes, capital gains tax as well"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1057960,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "taxes, exit taxes, and inheritance taxes"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1061840,
    "dDurationMs": 3440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to make tax dodging\nas hard as it can possibly be."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1065520,
    "dDurationMs": 3280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You may also need to come together\nwith other countries or sometimes"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1069040,
    "dDurationMs": 5200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "even within states, to coordinate taxes\nin such a way that they work in a world"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1074320,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "where there is free trade\nand free movement of capital."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1077840,
    "dDurationMs": 3720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Not an easy task, but it is possible\nfor people who are willing"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1081560,
    "dDurationMs": 4320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to think a bit beyond\nsimplistic wealth tax proposals."
    } ]
  } ]
}
